# ==============================================================================
# Git Ignore Configuration for Assignment 2 (Speech & Language Processing)
# Strictly aligned with Assignment 2a and Assignment 2b deliverables
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Python & Environment
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
env/
**/env/
venv/
**/venv/
.venv/
**/.venv/
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

